Version 1.2 (September 19, 1999)
~~~~~~~~~~~
+ Added text/data search by pressing F7

+ Screen scroll on moving by Up/Down arrows

+ History in edit controls

* Small cosmetical changes.


Version 1.1 (September 5, 1999)
~~~~~~~~~~~
+ Now you can edit data at any address. Use PgUp/PgDn to turn the pages,
  Ctrl-Home/End to move to the home/end of the file, F5 to go to the specified
  address.

* Small cosmetical changes.
